{"seq":3,"slug":"fermentation-science","title":"发酵科学","stage":"DONE","category":"cooking-food-science","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/h/cooking-food-science/fermentation-science","rating":{"composite":3.83,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.4,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4,"strategic":3.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.2,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.25}},"introMarkdown":"# 发酵科学\n\n发酵科学（Fermentation Science）是研究微生物在厌氧或微需氧条件下将有机底物转化为特定代谢产物的系统学科。从公元前 7000 年中国贾湖遗址出土的含酒精陶器残留物，到 2026 年中科院青岛能源所开发的 Process Ramanomics 实时单细胞监控平台，人类对发酵过程的理解经历了从经验技艺到精准调控的范式跃迁。\n\n发酵的本质是微生物的能量代谢。在缺氧环境中，酵母菌通过糖酵解途径（EMP pathway）将葡萄糖降解为丙酮酸，再经乙醇脱氢酶还原为乙醇和 CO₂——这就是酒精发酵的核心反应。乳酸菌则将丙酮酸直接还原为乳酸，赋予泡菜、酸奶独特的酸爽风味。曲霉（Aspergillus oryzae）分泌的蛋白酶和淀粉酶将大豆蛋白和淀粉水解为氨基酸和糖，构成酱油味噌鲜味的分子基础。\n\n发酵科学与食品安全密不可分。发酵产生的有机酸降低 pH 值、乙醇抑制病原菌、细菌素（bacteriocin）精准杀灭竞争微生物——这些天然屏障使发酵食品成为人类最古老的食品保藏技术之一。同时，现代精准发酵（Precision Fermentation）技术利用基因工程微生物定向生产特定蛋白质和功能成分，正在重塑全球食品工业格局。\n\n本 Hub 按照发酵科学的核心知识体系组织为四个章节：\n\n- **发酵微生物学基础**：微生物代谢路径、发酵剂菌种管理、发酵动力学模型\n- **酒精发酵**：葡萄酒、啤酒、蒸馏酒的科学原理与工艺控制\n- **乳酸发酵**：乳制品发酵、蔬菜腌制、酸面团的微生物学机制\n- **亚洲发酵传统**：酱油味噌的曲霉体系、醋酸发酵、发酵茶与康普茶\n\n每章深入剖析微生物群落结构、代谢通路、风味化合物生成机理及工艺参数优化，兼顾传统智慧与前沿技术的融合视角。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"fermentation-microbiology","title":"发酵微生物学基础","docCount":3,"url":"/h/cooking-food-science/fermentation-science/fermentation-microbiology","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"microbial-metabolism","title":"微生物代谢路径","url":"/h/cooking-food-science/fermentation-science/fermentation-microbiology/microbial-metabolism"},{"seq":2,"slug":"starter-cultures","title":"发酵剂与菌种管理","url":"/h/cooking-food-science/fermentation-science/fermentation-microbiology/starter-cultures"},{"seq":3,"slug":"fermentation-kinetics","title":"发酵动力学","url":"/h/cooking-food-science/fermentation-science/fermentation-microbiology/fermentation-kinetics"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"alcoholic-fermentation","title":"酒精发酵","docCount":3,"url":"/h/cooking-food-science/fermentation-science/alcoholic-fermentation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"wine-fermentation","title":"葡萄酒发酵","url":"/h/cooking-food-science/fermentation-science/alcoholic-fermentation/wine-fermentation"},{"seq":2,"slug":"beer-brewing-science","title":"啤酒酿造科学","url":"/h/cooking-food-science/fermentation-science/alcoholic-fermentation/beer-brewing-science"},{"seq":3,"slug":"spirits-distillation","title":"蒸馏酒与中国白酒","url":"/h/cooking-food-science/fermentation-science/alcoholic-fermentation/spirits-distillation"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"lactic-acid-fermentation","title":"乳酸发酵","docCount":3,"url":"/h/cooking-food-science/fermentation-science/lactic-acid-fermentation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"yogurt-cheese-science","title":"酸奶与奶酪科学","url":"/h/cooking-food-science/fermentation-science/lactic-acid-fermentation/yogurt-cheese-science"},{"seq":2,"slug":"vegetable-fermentation","title":"蔬菜发酵：泡菜、酸菜与 Kimchi","url":"/h/cooking-food-science/fermentation-science/lactic-acid-fermentation/vegetable-fermentation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"sourdough-science","title":"酸面团科学","url":"/h/cooking-food-science/fermentation-science/lactic-acid-fermentation/sourdough-science"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"asian-fermentation-traditions","title":"亚洲发酵传统","docCount":3,"url":"/h/cooking-food-science/fermentation-science/asian-fermentation-traditions","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"soy-sauce-miso","title":"酱油与味噌：曲霉发酵","url":"/h/cooking-food-science/fermentation-science/asian-fermentation-traditions/soy-sauce-miso"},{"seq":2,"slug":"vinegar-acetic-fermentation","title":"醋与醋酸发酵","url":"/h/cooking-food-science/fermentation-science/asian-fermentation-traditions/vinegar-acetic-fermentation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"fermented-tea-kombucha","title":"发酵茶与康普茶","url":"/h/cooking-food-science/fermentation-science/asian-fermentation-traditions/fermented-tea-kombucha"}]}]}